    "title": "Vote Dupuis | Letters To Editor | ellsworthamerican.com",
    "text": "To the Editor:\nI realize that the Hancock County Sheriff’s race is a serious subject deserving of a thoughtful amount of research before casting a vote. However, it also seems to me that there is enough backstory to make an interesting and dramatic Netflix miniseries! (Maybe with the addition of a few extra flourishes by a skilled screenwriter.)",
